That's odd that you didn't notice the special ability the Amulet of Yendor
gives you.  While wearing it, every 50-100 moves or so you get a partial magic
mapping effect.  I mean, you move and all of a sudden part of that level
becomes visible to you, like you've already visted there.  This has happened
every time I have worn it, I wonder if it always works...  You can get this
special ability sometimes by sacrificing many monsters at an altar, too.

The Amulet of Yendor has a special purpose for the very end of the game, too.
But that is too big a spoiler to put in public, like rec.games.hack.

